	(text "TABEL KEBENARAN §57 — SEMUA KONDISI GAGAL → K1 DE-ENERGIZED (SAFETY REVIEW):\n 1. ESP32 OFF / reset / boot / crash / watchdog → GPIO27 floating-LOW\n    → PC817 mati → Q20 OFF (R71 pulldown) → K1 OFF\n 2. GPIO27 stuck-LOW (fault MCU) → PC817 mati → Q20 OFF → K1 OFF\n 3. Rail +3V3 hilang → LED PC817 mati → Q20 OFF → K1 OFF\n 4. Rail +5V / +5V_RELAY hilang (DC/DC gagal / F2 putus) → coil\n    tanpa suplai → K1 OFF\n 5. E-STOP DITEKAN (loop NC terbuka) → jalur SUPPLAI coil terputus\n    FISIK — TANPA firmware (kriteria utama §57) → K1 OFF\n 6. Kabel loop E-stop putus / konektor lepas → loop open → K1 OFF\n 7. Drive gate hilang (CTR PC817 turun / R70 putus) → R71\n    default-OFF → Q20 OFF → K1 OFF\n 8. Coil K1 putus / sambungan gagal → kontak NO tetap terbuka → K1 OFF\n 9. Suplai baterai 48 V hilang → board mati total → K1 OFF\n CATATAN FAULT: Q20 short D-S → coil tetap bisa energized, TAPI\n    E-stop TETAP memutus sisi SUPPLAI (bukan drain) → pemutus\n    darurat tetap efektif — inilah alasan topologi."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 145 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ffab2287-aef5-440c-b0f6-8d5be65e37e3")	)
	(text "TOPOLOGI TERKUNCI §11.1 AUDIT — TIDAK BOLEH DIUBAH (LARANGAN #7):\n E-STOP MEMUTUS SISI SUPPLAI COIL — BUKAN SISI DRAIN — JANGAN\n DIPINDAH. GPIO27 HIGH = energized (kontrak repo): (3,3 − 1,2)/330\n = 6,4 mA (IF maks PC817 50 mA; CTR ≥ 50% → arus output ≥ 3,2 mA\n memadai utk gate Q20).\n +5V → F2 0,5A + FB50 (SHEET 01) → +5V_RELAY → J_ESTOP.1 → loop\n NC eksternal → J_ESTOP.2 = RELAY_RET → K1 COIL → drain Q20 → PGND\n (star BATTERY−). D21 SS14 flyback: katoda=RELAY_RET, anoda=drain\n (40 V/1 A vs arus coil ~125 mA = margin 8×; audit §11.1).\n TVS FIELD D22/D23 SMAJ5.0A (unidirectional; VRWM 5 V; VC ~9,2 V @\n IPP): D22 di J_ESTOP.1 (+5V_RELAY), D23 di J_ESTOP.2 (RELAY_RET),\n kathoda ke jalur + anoda ke PGND — proteksi transien kabel field.\n SENSE (audit §11.1): loop tertutup + suplai normal → RELAY_RET ≈\n 5 V − I×R_loop → node = 5 × 68/(47+68) = 2,96 V (HIGH = E-stop OK;\n < 3,6 V abs.maks ADC); loop terbuka → node ≈ 0 V (LOW). τ = 27,9k\n × 100nF ≈ 2,8 ms → DEBOUNCE SOFTWARE WAJIB (HW hanya RC). Mismatch\n firmware: RELAY_CTRL HIGH + sense LOW = ALARM (loop gagal)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 205 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3946b3c4-0a11-49b6-94f8-2608a89c39b6")	)
	(text "KOMPONEN KUNCI + ITEM VERIFIKASI BOM (GATE e SAFETY REVIEW):\n OPT1 PC817 (DIP-4; Vce 80 V, CTR 50–300%): isolasi drive — domain\n   LED = DGND (return GPIO27), domain output = +5V/PGND (DN-S6-02).\n Q20 AO3400A (SOT-23; 30 V/5,7 A; Vgs(th) 0,7–1,4 V; Rds ~28 mΩ @\n   4,5 V): low-side switch coil; margin Vds 30 V ≫ clamp TVS 9,2 V.\n K1 = HF115F-1/5V-H Hongfa PRELIM (1 Form A SPST-NO; kontak ≥ 5 A/\n   30 VDC per audit §11.1). ASUMSI #6: VERIFIKASI rating kontak +\n   INRUSH kontaktor aktual = ITEM BOM S10 — bila inrush > 5 A →\n   naik kelas (Omron G6RL / Hongfa HFE10) atau relai antara.\n   Pemetaan pin simbol (1=COIL+ 2=COIL− 3=COM 4=NO) ke pin fisik\n   HF115F-1 = VERIFIKASI DATASHEET BOM S10 (footprint parametrik\n   turunan pola keluarga HF115F resmi 2Z-x4; pad 2,3 / drill 1,3).\n R72 330R / R70 100R / R71 100k / R75 47k / R76 68k / C75 100nF\n   (0603 1% X7R). D21 SS14 + D22/D23 SMAJ5.0A (SMA).\n J_ESTOP & J_RELAY = Phoenix MKDS-1,5-2 P5,08 (SELV; dry contact)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 225 145 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1264837f-8ced-405a-a57f-b4af8e01783b")	)
	(text "PENEMPATAN (S9): rantai E-stop di zona power dekat tepi board;\n   loop J_ESTOP pendek & jauh dari antenna ESP32; K1 kontak\n   menjauh dari zona analog; jalur PGND source Q20 langsung ke\n   star; D21 dekat pin coil K1; D22/D23 < 10 mm dari J_ESTOP.\n FW-SYNC: GPIO27 floating saat boot → R71 menjamin Q20 OFF → K1\n   OFF sampai firmware HIGH; E_STOP_SENSE dibaca dgn debounce\n   ≥ 10 ms + alarm mismatch GPIO27-vs-sense; tabel 9 kondisi =\n   basis TEST_PLAN rantai E-stop (S11 §57).\n CATATAN ERC: label RELAY_CTRL & E_STOP_SENSE kini ber-kontrapart\n   (dangling 7→5; sisa GPIO13/23/33/36/39 = J_EXP S7). Ground\n   katoda PC817 + bawah divider = DGND (domain referensi ADC\n   GPIO14 — DN-S6-02; equipotensial PGND via NT2 arsitektur §3.4,\n   penempatan S9; arus divider 43 µA); source Q20 + R71 + TVS =\n   PGND (domain daya, arus coil ~125 mA kembali ke star)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 225 205 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "edd4248a-1a19-4744-9cd4-dff51c01e80d")	)
	(text_box "09_EMERGENCY — rantai E-stop SAFETY-CRITICAL (S6, §57/§11.1 audit).\nDrive: GPIO27 (RELAY_CTRL) → R72 330R → OPT1 PC817 (katoda DGND;\n  HIGH=energized, 6,4 mA) → R70 100R → gate Q20 AO3400A; R71 100k\n  gate→PGND (default OFF saat floating).\nLoop daya: +5V → F2+FB50 (sheet 01) → +5V_RELAY → J_ESTOP.1 → loop\n  NC eksternal → J_ESTOP.2 = RELAY_RET → K1 coil → drain Q20 → PGND.\n  D21 SS14 flyback (K=RELAY_RET, A=drain); TVS D22/D23 SMAJ5.0A di\n  J_ESTOP.1/.2 ke PGND (transien field).\nSense: RELAY_RET → R75 47k → E_STOP_SENSE → R76 68k → DGND + C75\n  100nF → GPIO14 (2,96 V loop-OK / 0 V terbuka; DN-S6-02).\nKontak K1 COM+NO → J_RELAY (dry — aktuator kontaktor darurat).\nE-STOP MEMUTUS SISI SUPPLAI COIL — bukan sisi drain — JANGAN\n  DIPINDAH. Tabel kebenaran 9 kondisi §57 di sheet ini (WAJIB).\nGATE S6: 9 kondisi §57 → K1 de-energized; R71 default-OFF; flyback\n  hadir; sense 2,96 V/0 V (hitung ulang); rating K1 = item BOM S10."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(size 190 46)
		(stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type none))
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "55918713-ab7a-4e9d-9563-4ac437fbbece")
	)
